  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "囚室日記"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>作者：</span>王秀靖</span></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">想bē到有史以來，阮旅社蹛上久ê一kái——七暝七工，就是tī疫情tng-leh燒ê時， hōo人掠做是去蹛「防疫旅館」。厝頭家tshuā師傅來看阮兜ê浴間仔，講阮ê浴間仔漏水，漏到樓跤去。為著beh做浴間仔ê防水工程，規个浴間仔lóng ài khà掉重做，ài七工tsiah做ē好。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">自án-ne，阮就包袱款款--leh，去蹛旅社。我感覺tsiânn無奈，無代無誌關tī旅社七工，三頓lóng ài冒險出去買，早時mā無法度lim家己煮ê咖啡，真鬱卒。 阮對樓跤ê厝邊感覺歹勢，hōo in承阮ê lah-sap水。厝頭家kap師傅一直講新ê浴間仔ē tsiok suí--ê，阮mā無期待，阮對本底ê浴間仔已經真滿意--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">雖然旅社是阮家己揣--ê，m̄-koh驚厝頭家嫌siunn貴，無願意tàu付，阮m̄敢揣khah sù-sī--ê，清氣就好。本來『宅』tī厝，mā有20坪；tsit-má，關tī tsit間旅社ê房間：一塊桌仔、兩塊椅仔、眠床kap浴間仔，鬥--起-來tsiah四、五坪niâ。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">規工m̄是坐tī椅仔頂，就是倒tī眠床頂；椅仔到眠床免一步，眠床到便所免十步，tse是「上遠ê距離」。逐工就是椅仔、眠床、便所換來換去，親像leh坐監。頭一工蹛了真無爽快，suah人siān-siān，規工nuà tī眠床頂，無做半項代誌，hōo我有罪惡感。了後，精神khah好--一-點-仔；m̄-koh，看冊、tsiūnn網路mā無法度維持偌久。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">為著振作，我開始寫日記——用台語來寫日記。無意料效果tsiânn好，m̄-na無睏--去，精神koh tsiânn好。寫日記度時間，ná寫ná查詞典，ke減學一寡仔台語詞，tsiânn無閒。朋友講「追劇」khah好刣時間；我寫日記刣時間，寫kah真歡喜。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">總算beh出關--ah，想beh tńg去看新ê浴間仔生做啥款。人ê潛力tsiânn實無可限量，tshím頭，我感覺tī tsit个囚室內蹛七工，我ē起痟；等揣著心適ê代誌thang做，真緊就bē記得無爽快ê所在，漸漸仔慣勢tsia ê環境。Tī tsia，有thang lim、有thang食、有thang寫、有thang學、koh有thang運動——原地走標，無啥mi̍h好埋怨。&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">我想起《安妮日記》，he是伊leh避難ê時tsūn，bih tī祕密ê小閣樓所寫--ê。伊是leh bih Nazi（『納粹』）大屠殺，阮是leh bih武漢肺炎ê疫情；伊bih tī小閣樓，我bih tī小旅社；阮lóng leh寫日記，記錄人生。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ǹ<span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">g望疫情趕緊退--去，阮兜ê浴間仔永遠bē koh漏水</span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">。</span></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiv6zb32qTIMsgpdQsNJdA82E7RHfA3uchglysPx4NW0_DoVWz24jMBdgtsZ0IDnFIVBycyOd9Bx9EWUL2rdC9sdRM9z6eQx3PyrGUTFMSl6NKMEmwdvaINERXYlCUNjL6A4G_KzTCTO3em/s1424/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiv6zb32qTIMsgpdQsNJdA82E7RHfA3uchglysPx4NW0_DoVWz24jMBdgtsZ0IDnFIVBycyOd9Bx9EWUL2rdC9sdRM9z6eQx3PyrGUTFMSl6NKMEmwdvaINERXYlCUNjL6A4G_KzTCTO3em/w450-h640/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhV54y1iEhJIZr-8Lr-jWDxtzIh-eg2TGIQre6Dkelyo2r9dVnmuqYIfTKliyjkXBOe0-ca3vbkRx6qxwi_p4h_LcQWzyhcXk2h2eUExAyPCyAHSr5aoR3-d80ITO1f_nasuVv3eod6-qfJ/s2048/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581020021.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1446\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhV54y1iEhJIZr-8Lr-jWDxtzIh-eg2TGIQre6Dkelyo2r9dVnmuqYIfTKliyjkXBOe0-ca3vbkRx6qxwi_p4h_LcQWzyhcXk2h2eUExAyPCyAHSr5aoR3-d80ITO1f_nasuVv3eod6-qfJ/w640-h452/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581020021.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span><b>#</b></span><b>生活ê藝術&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報330期，2021年9月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">--------------------------------------------</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"font-size: medium;\" /></div></div></div></span></div>"
